    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our joint research programme with a French public AI research laboratory on retrieval-augmented generation and explainability will help address the need for explainable recommendations or suggestions produced by The solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure seamless integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), our will leverage our partnership with Ligeo Santé, a health-IT integrator. our dedicated team, consisting of a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, will work closely with the client's to design and implement The solution. our governance practices, including a joint steering committee, operational committee, RACI matrix, single point of contact, and documented escalation path, will ensure effective communication and decision-making throughout The solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following our phased approach (Framing, Design, Pilot, Generalisation, and Run), our can progressively deploy The solution, starting with a pilot phase on a limited perimeter, and then generalizing to all services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements for response times compatible with daily clinical use, our will prioritize the development of a solution that provides fast and reliable access to information, while ensuring the continuity of care between professionals, shifts, and services. our change-management and training resources will support hospital staff in adapting to The solution, minimizing any potential disruption to hospital staff workflows." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our approach will focus on delivering a high-quality AI assistance solution that meets the client's needs, while ensuring strict compliance with regulatory requirements, data sovereignty, and medical confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects a solution that integrates with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), supports health interoperability standards (HL7 / FHIR), and provides API-type interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

