        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integration with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), our can utilize our standard connectors and custom adapters as needed. our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform also supports health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR through our fhir_hl7_connector, ensuring seamless communication between systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

