        ex:hasText "Given our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture as of 2024, what are the potential legal risks and liabilities associated with this project?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our company's legal standing as a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) in France, our company's experience with French public procurement, and our company's existing intellectual property model, insurance coverage, and regulatory compliance posture, several potential legal risks and liabilities associated with this project can be identified." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, given that this project must not require medical-device qualification and is positioned as an assistance tool, there is a risk of inadvertently crossing the threshold into medical device territory. our company's Legal function would need to carefully monitor a risk of inadvertently crossing the threshold into medical device territory and flag any potential CE/MDR implications, as well as consequences for liability and positioning." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, the requirement that no clinical or medico-administrative decision may be automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional imposes a significant responsibility on the client's staff. our company's would need to ensure that this project provides appropriate functionality for staff to review and validate decisions, while also avoiding any language or marketing that could be seen as promoting automated decision-making without proper oversight." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thirdly, as this project will involve processing sensitive health data, our company's must guarantee strict compliance with GDPR, including Article 9 special-category data and Article 28 processing agreements. our company's existing professional liability insurance coverage of €10 million per claim should help mitigate some of the risks associated with data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Fourthly, from a contractual perspective, our company's would need to negotiate standard public clauses (e.g., CCAG-TIC) that allocate liabilities appropriately between the parties. our company's experience with framework agreements and our company's ability to lead a small consortium could be beneficial in navigating these contractual complexities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, considering the EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in health contexts as of 2024, our company's would need to ensure that this project complies with the EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in health contexts as of 2024, particularly given the use of proprietary and open-source components, as well as third-party models under commercial licenses. our company's existing regulatory compliance posture, maintained by our company's Security & Compliance function, should help navigate the EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in health contexts as of 2024." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, while there are potential legal risks and liabilities associated with this project, our company's existing capabilities, experience, and regulatory compliance posture provide a solid foundation for mitigating potential legal risks and liabilities associated with this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Close monitoring of the medical device threshold, careful contract negotiation, and strict GDPR compliance will be essential to ensuring the success of this project." ;
